## Model card

- **Name:** Iceman
- **Short description:** OpenCode's anonymous stealth reasoning model, offered as a free contributor-tier model where prompts and completions are retained for training. Speculated to be an upstream preview from a major lab (possibly Microsoft MAI series), but unattributed.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Console and Go (`opencode/iceman-free`). Free contributor tier with data retention.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released on OpenCode platform; exact date and knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `opencode/iceman-free` (also referenced as `iceman-contributor-free`)
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens (262K) input / 131,072 tokens (131K) max output — per meta.json and platform docs.
- **Modalities:** Text in; text out only. Reasoning capability and native tool-calling support.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free (prompts and completions retained for model training).
- **Architecture:** Unknown/proprietary. Anonymous stealth model with no disclosed parameter count, architecture details, or open weights.

